{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"0fbf02ea","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.004126,"end_time":"2026-11-26T08:12:28.909113+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-26T08:12:28.904987+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# PTB-XL 12-lead ECG — Multi-paper research pipeline\n","\n","Ek notebook, chaar papers ke recipes combine karke. Har stage kis paper se aaya hai:\n","\n","| Stage | Base paper | Is notebook mein kya liya |\n","|---|---|---|\n","| 1. Data + labels + split | Wagner et al. 2020 (PTB-XL, *Sci. Data*) | `strat_fold` split (1–8 train, 9 val, 10 test), SCP label aggregation |\n","| 2. Preprocessing | Strodthoff et al. 2021 (PTB-XL benchmark, *IEEE JBHI*) | 100 Hz, StandardScaler fit only on train, 2.5 s random windows |\n","| 3. Augmentation | Mehari & Strodthoff 2022 (*Comput. Biol. Med.*) | Random Resized Crop + Time Out (best pair in their ablation), physio-noise |\n","| 4a. Supervised models | Strodthoff 2021 | `xresnet1d101`, `inception1d`, concat-pool head, AdamW + 1-cycle, BCE |\n","| 4b. SSL #1 — CPC | Mehari & Strodthoff 2022 | 4FC encoder + 2-layer LSTM, predict 12 steps, 128 negatives, two-step finetune + discriminative LRs |\n","| 4c. SSL #2 — Masked Transformer | Zhou et al. (MTECG) | segment tokens, 25% masking, per-segment-norm target, 1-layer decoder, layer-wise LR decay 0.6, DropPath 0.4 |\n","| 5. Evaluation | Strodthoff 2021 | sliding-window TTA, term-centric macro AUC, F<sub>β=2</sub>/G<sub>β=2</sub>, bootstrap 95% CI, paired significance, ensemble |\n","\n","**Reference numbers (task `all`, 71 labels, macro AUC on fold 10):**\n","- supervised xresnet1d101 ≈ **0.925** (Strodthoff 2021)\n","- CPC pretrained on PTB-XL only → finetuned ≈ **0.9395**; pretrained on CinC2020+PTB-XL ≈ **0.9418** (Mehari 2022)\n","- MTECG reports macro-F1, not AUC, and pretrained on an *external* corpus for PTB-XL — PTB-XL-only pretraining yahan weaker ho sakta hai. Extra unlabeled ECG (e.g. Chapman) ke liye `EXTRA_PRETRAIN_NPY` hook hai.\n","\n","**Run order:** Config cell set karo → *Run All*. Har experiment apne predictions `OUT_DIR` mein save karta hai; dobara run karne pe trained experiments skip ho jaate hain (`FORCE_RETRAIN=False`). Pretraining checkpoints resume hote hain.\n","\n","Pehli baar `QUICK_DEBUG = True` karke chalao (minutes mein pura pipeline check), phir `False`.\n","\n","**Kaggle pe raat bhar unattended run:**\n","1. Accelerator = *GPU T4 x2* (2 GPUs → `nn.DataParallel` auto). Device cell mein `GPUs: 2` dikhna chahiye.\n","2. *Save Version → Save & Run All (Commit)* → browser band karke so jao. Run background mein chalta hai.\n","3. `TIME_BUDGET_H` (default 11.5 h on Kaggle) se pehle notebook khud ruk jaata hai, checkpoint save karta hai, aur jo experiments complete hue unka final evaluation chala deta hai → outputs safe.\n","4. Kuch adhoora reh gaya toh: notebook mein *Add Input → Your Work → is notebook ka pichla version* attach karo, `RESUME_FROM = ['/kaggle/input/<naam>']` set karo, dobara commit. Finished experiments load hote hain, paused wale wahin se resume."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"ce51a51d","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-26T08:12:28.917012Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-26T08:12:28.91646Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-26T08:12:43.051845Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-26T08:12:43.050911Z"},"papermill":{"duration":14.141169,"end_time":"2026-11-26T08:12:43.053538+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-26T08:12:28.912369+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Collecting wfdb\r\n","  Downloading wfdb-5.3.0-py3-none-any.whl.metadata (5.2 kB)\r\n","Requirement already satisfied: torch in /usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages (2.11.0+cu130)\r\n","Requirement already satisfied: scikit-learn in /usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages (1.6.1)\r\n","Requirement already satisfied: pandas in /usr/local/lib/python3.13/dist-packages (2.3.3)\r\n","Requiremen